(A small shared library, built with `vox --shared`. Its companions are
mathkit_consumer.vox, which consumes it from Vox through `see` of a `.lib`,
and mathkit_driver.asm, which calls it from a foreign host. See LANGUAGE.md,
"Shared libraries".

  vox examples/mathkit_lib.vox --shared -o examples/libmathkit.so)

Library mathkit version "1.0".

To 'add two numbers' with a number called aa and a number called b. Return a number, aa add b.

To greet.
  Print "hello from mathkit".